45417] [17592186060584 #edb/ref 1061 15718 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060584 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "837e91b7-ecc8-5eb1-9d91-ec7da4d94000" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060584 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186060907 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060585 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186060586 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060585 #edb/ref 1061 15719 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060585 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "1190044a-3906-5ae4-a51e-538cf356a2c5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060585 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186059710 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060586 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186060587 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060586 #edb/ref 1061 15720 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060586 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "a19152f2-0fbd-557f-99bc-5538856ff2bf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060586 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186060908 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060587 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186060588 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060587 #edb/ref 1061 15721 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060587 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e88a1726-2670-547f-b2f0-8d69c9477c46" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060587 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186059711 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060588 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186060589 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060588 #edb/ref 1061 15722 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060588 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d24272c4-4b3f-573c-becb-933a5b273063" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060588 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186059712 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060589 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186060590 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060589 #edb/ref 1061 15723 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060589 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d6999bc8-a1c0-546d-91dd-6cca922d8030" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060589 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186060909 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060590 #edb/ref 1061 15727 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060590 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "75a612c3-28ca-509c-a97e-97bfc17a7e08" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060590 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186059713 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060907 #edb/ref 1064 "Suppose we are given two vectors \n$\\mathbf{a} = \\langle 2,3 \\rangle$ and $\\mathbf{b} = \\langle -4,4 \\rangle,$ shown below. How do we compute the vectors $\\mathbf{a} + \\mathbf{b}$  and  $-5\\mathbf{a}$ in terms of the standard basis $\\mathbf{i},\\mathbf{j}?$\n\n![](images/25/254809cbc834b493759a6fa09222a2c90c5fbfc3280d22e82470e760a7a4c508.png)\n\nTo compute $\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b},$ we collect all of the $\\mathbf{i}$'s and $\\mathbf{j}$'s. We know that $\\mathbf{a} = {\\color{red}2}\\mathbf{i} + {\\color{blue}3}\\mathbf{j}$ and $\\mathbf{b} = {\\color{red}-4}\\mathbf{i} + {\\color{blue}4}\\mathbf{j}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a+b & =(2i+3j)+(-4i+4j) \\\\  & =(2+(-4))i+(3+4)j \\\\  & =-2i+7j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWriting our answer in angle bracket and column vector notations, we get \n![](images/ea/eae25a74dde73f7899f6ccbbdbb1a1f589fc72cad9629a33b4fdbbbc753efcd8.svg)\n\nTo compute $-5\\mathbf{a},$ we multiply each of the components by $-5\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5\\cdot a & =-5(2i+3j) \\\\  & =(-5\\cdot 2)i+(-5\\cdot 3)j \\\\  & =-10i+-15j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWriting our answer in angle bracket and column vector notations, we get \n![](images/05/05f847a73201db3de20db3847ef4ed97e07ea7fae9325401b1ea5a460968f9da.svg)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060907 #edb/ref 1065 2914 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060907 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "84c864c1-dd6f-5d3a-96de-fba662bed5ff" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060907 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060908 #edb/ref 1064 "To add or subtract vectors given in angle bracket or column vector form, we just need to add or subtract each component separately.\n\nFor example, in angle bracket notation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨2,5⟩+⟨-3,7⟩ & = \\\\ ⟨2+(-3),5+7⟩ & = \\\\ ⟨-1,12⟩ & ,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand in column vector notation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2+(-3) \\\\ 5+7\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, to multiply a vector given in angle bracket or column vector form, we just need to multiply each component separately.\n\nFor example, in angle bracket notation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5\\cdot ⟨2,5⟩ & = \\\\ ⟨(-5)\\cdot 2,(-5)\\cdot 5⟩ & = \\\\ ⟨-10,-25⟩ & ,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand in column vector notation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}(-5)\\cdot 2 \\\\ (-5)\\cdot 5\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-10 \\\\ -25\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060908 #edb/ref 1065 2915 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060908 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "25665086-90db-5c8c-b344-69f6f45aac54" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060908 #edb/ref 1067 "Sums and Scalar Multiplication of Vectors in Angle Bracket or Column Vector Form" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060909 #edb/ref 1064 "To denote a vector, we have used two notations:\n\n- a single bold lowercase letter, such as $\\mathbf{v},$ or\n\n- two uppercase letters representing the points of the ends of the vector, with an arrow over them, such as $\\overrightarrow{AB}.$\n\nWe will mostly stick to these notations. However, there are many possible notations for vectors. For example, sometimes a vector can be denoted as\n\n$$\n\\vec{v}, \\quad \\overrightarrow{V}, \\quad v, \\quad \\hat{v}.\n$$\n\nThe rightmost notation, $\\hat{v},$ is usually used to represent unit vectors in particular." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060909 #edb/ref 1065 2916 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060909 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "25d66dd7-21a2-5d10-a19d-333e279d6e7f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186060909 #edb/ref 1067 "Common Notations Used When Describing Vectors" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186509348 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509373 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509348 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509348 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $2a-2b+4c$ if $a=7i+7j$, $b=-9i-5j$, and $c=-7i+9j$." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509348 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "0398c68e-1be2-5db6-aaf0-c271dda78fcc" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509348 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $2a-2b+4c,$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2a-2b+4c &= 2(7i+7j) - 2(-9i-5j) + 4(-7i+9j) \\\\\n&= 14i + 14j + 18i + 10j - 28i + 36j \\\\\n&= (14i + 18i - 28i) + (14j + 10j + 36j) \\\\\n&= 4i + 60j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509350 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509441 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509350 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509350 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $3a + b$ if $a = -8i - 5j$ and $b = -5i - 4j$." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509350 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "045e65fe-705f-5b7f-8be0-d19cac68cb9c" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509350 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $3a+b,$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n3a+b &= 3(-8i-5j) + (-5i-4j) \\\\\n&= -24i - 15j - 5i - 4j \\\\\n&= (-24i - 5i) + (-15j - 4j) \\\\\n&= -29i - 19j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509352 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509410 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509352 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509352 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $3a-3(b-(-3c))$ if $a=-6i+j$, $b=-5i-2j$, and $c=-2i-j$." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509352 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "05b5a69f-559f-50d9-aa5b-5aaeee2612b5" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509352 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $3a-3(b-(-3c)),$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n3a-3(b-(-3c)) &= 3(-6i+j)-3((-5i-2j)-(-3)(-2i-j)) \\\\\n&= 3(-6i+j)-3(-11i-5j) \\\\\n&= -18i + 3j + 15i + 6j + 18i + 9j \\\\\n&= (-18i + 15i + 18i) + (3j + 6j + 9j) \\\\\n&= 15i + 18j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509354 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509429 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509354 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509354 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $a+2b$ if $a=-6i-j$ and $b=-6i+5j.$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509354 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "085803b4-79ae-5f17-a8ef-e17ea98a4541" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509354 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $a+2b,$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a+2b & =(-6i-j)+2(-6i+5j) \\\\  & =-6i-j-12i+10j \\\\  & =(-6i-12i)+(-j+10j) \\\\  & =-18i+9j\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509362 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509389 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509362 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509362 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $3a+2b$ if $a=4i-8j$ and $b=12i-7j.$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509362 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "2acad342-3a8a-53ea-a481-5450f3aeed7a" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509362 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $3a+2b,$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3a+2b & =3(4i-8j)+2(12i-7j) \\\\  & =12i-24j+24i-14j \\\\  & =(12i+24i)+(-24j-14j) \\\\  & =36i-38j\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509365 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509376 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509365 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509365 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $3a-3(b-2c)$ if $a=2i+2j$, $b=-6i-4j$, and $c=-5i+3j$." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509365 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "32eb1a90-349a-5ff7-af75-4919ee0724ca" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509365 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $3a-3(b-2c),$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n3a-3(b-2c) &= 3(2i+2j)-3((-6i-4j)-2(-5i+3j)) \\\\\n&= 3(2i+2j)-3(4i-10j) \\\\\n&= 6i + 6j + 18i + 12j - 30i + 18j \\\\\n&= (6i + 18i - 30i) + (6j + 12j + 18j) \\\\\n&= -6i + 36j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509384 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509436 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509384 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509384 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $2a-3(b-2c)$ if $a=-3i-j$, $b=-3i+3j$, and $c=5i+6j$." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509384 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "5c14e756-1596-53cd-886b-e6efbdc8e75e" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509384 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $2a-3(b-2c),$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2a-3(b-2c) &= 2(-3i-j)-3((-3i+3j)-2(5i+6j)) \\\\\n&= 2(-3i-j)-3(-13i-9j) \\\\\n&= -6i - 2j + 9i - 9j + 30i + 36j \\\\\n&= (-6i + 9i + 30i) + (-2j - 9j + 36j) \\\\\n&= 33i + 25j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509387 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509426 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509387 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509387 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $-3a+4b+2c$ if $a=-4i-8j$, $b=9i-5j$, and $c=8i-7j$." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509387 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "6adf4f40-41a4-5d15-9e37-4a3e80854af3" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509387 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $-3a+4b+2c,$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-3a+4b+2c &= -3(-4i-8j) + 4(9i-5j) + 2(8i-7j) \\\\\n&= 12i + 24j + 36i - 20j + 16i - 14j \\\\\n&= (12i + 36i + 16i) + (24j - 20j - 14j) \\\\\n&= 64i - 10j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509400 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509450 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509400 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509400 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $-2a-4b-3c$ if $a=7i-5j$, $b=-4i+3j$, and $c=i-7j$." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509400 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "8597697b-28d1-53e1-99fa-2b0916a7208f" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509400 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $-2a-4b-3c,$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-2a-4b-3c &= -2(7i-5j) - 4(-4i+3j) - 3(i-7j) \\\\\n&= -14i + 10j + 16i - 12j - 3i + 21j \\\\\n&= (-14i + 16i - 3i) + (10j - 12j + 21j) \\\\\n&= -i + 19j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509403 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509383 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509403 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509403 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $3a+3b+4c$ if $a=-5i-2j$, $b=-2i-j$, and $c=2i+3j$." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509403 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "8be423a8-15b5-5642-ba3c-ae359c7f5206" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509403 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $3a+3b+4c,$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n3a+3b+4c &= 3(-5i-2j) + 3(-2i-j) + 4(2i+3j) \\\\\n&= -15i - 6j - 6i - 3j + 8i + 12j \\\\\n&= (-15i - 6i + 8i) + (-6j - 3j + 12j) \\\\\n&= -13i + 3j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509430 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509446 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509430 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509430 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $-2a-4b+4c$ if $a=-3i+3j$, $b=-3i+8j$, and $c=3i+j$." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509430 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "d4845205-9834-571a-844c-fb4721f39742" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509430 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute $-2a-4b+4c,$ we just need to compute all of the $i$'s and $j$'s, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-2a-4b+4c &= -2(-3i+3j) - 4(-3i+8j) + 4(3i+j) \\\\\n&= 6i - 6j + 12i - 32j + 12i + 4j \\\\\n&= (6i + 12i + 12i) + (-6j - 32j + 4j) \\\\\n&= 30i - 34j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509432 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186509401 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509432 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509432 #edb/ref 1071 "Find $a-2b$ if $a=-7i-11j$ and $b=8i+6j.$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186509432 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "da5c334a